#: ../../dev.md:23
msgid ""
"依赖方向单向：`views → libs/utils → models/basis`。`utils/web.py` 依赖 Flask 上下文， "
"不能被非 Web 模块导入；钩子只被 `libs/hook.py` 按需导入，禁止反向依赖业务层。"
msgstr ""
"Dependencies point one way: `views → libs/utils → models/basis`. "
"`utils/web.py` needs a Flask context and must never be imported by non-Web "
"modules; hooks are imported on demand by `libs/hook.py` only and must not "
"depend back on the business layer."

#: ../../dev.md:26
msgid "写扩展（存储驱动 / 登录 Provider / 界面钩子）的契约、最小样例与本地联调见[扩展开发](extend/index.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The contract, a minimal example and local debugging for extensions (storage"
" drivers / login providers / UI hooks) are in [Extension "
"development](extend/index.md)."

