msgstr "Common commands"

#: ../../dev.md:51
msgid "变量可覆盖：`make dev PORT=8080`、`make serve WORKERS=8`。"
msgstr "Variables can be overridden: `make dev PORT=8080`, `make serve WORKERS=8`."

#: ../../dev.md:54
msgid ""
"上面这些是 `Makefile` 的封装，只图本地少敲字：它们假定仓库根的 `.venv` 存在、机器上有 `make`。 "
"CI、容器与生产环境通常没有 `make`，请直接用真实命令——安装与启动见[安装与部署](install.md)， "
"生产部署的完整命令见[部署与运维](deploy.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The targets above wrap the `Makefile` to save typing locally: they assume a"
" repo-root `.venv` and `make` on the machine. CI, containers and production"
" usually have no `make`, so use the real commands — installation and "
"startup are in [Installation](install.md) and the full production commands "
"are in [Deployment and operations](deploy.md)."

#: ../../dev.md:58
msgid ""
"`make dev` 自己会带 `sapic_env=dev`（DEBUG + 详细日志）；`config` / `upgrade` / "
"`create-admin` 不带，用的是默认配置——没有 `server/.cfg` 也能直接跑，需要开发默认值时自己加 "
"`sapic_env=dev`。"
msgstr ""
"`make dev` sets `sapic_env=dev` itself (DEBUG + verbose logs); `config` / "
"`upgrade` / `create-admin` do not, so they run on the defaults — everything"
" works without a `server/.cfg`, and you add `sapic_env=dev` yourself when "
"you want the development defaults."

#: ../../dev.md:62
msgid "测试"
msgstr "Tests"

#: ../../dev.md:64
msgid "后端用 pytest，测试在 `server/tests/`，`cd server && python -m pytest -q`。"
msgstr ""
"The backend uses pytest with tests in `server/tests/`: `cd server && python"
" -m pytest -q`."

#: ../../dev.md:65
msgid "测试用临时 SQLite，不依赖外部数据库；CI 跑 Python 3.10 与 3.12。"
msgstr ""
"Tests use a temporary SQLite database and need no external service; CI runs"
" Python 3.10 and 3.12."

#: ../../dev.md:66
msgid "新增扩展契约、解析、权限判定时应补对应单测："
msgstr ""
"Add unit tests when you touch extension contracts, parsing or permission "
"decisions:"

#: ../../dev.md:74
msgid "文档"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: ../../dev.md:76
msgid "本文档用 Sphinx + MyST（Markdown）编写，配置在 `docs/conf.py`："
msgstr ""
"These docs are written in Sphinx + MyST (Markdown) and configured in "
"`docs/conf.py`:"

#: ../../dev.md:86
msgid "新增页面后在 `docs/index.md` 的 `toctree` 里登记，否则不会被构建。"
msgstr ""
"Register new pages in the `toctree` of `docs/index.md`, otherwise they are "
"not built."

#: ../../dev.md:87
msgid "`make docs` 自带 `-W`（warning 即失败）；改动文档后本地跑一次再提交。"
msgstr ""
"`make docs` runs with `-W` (a warning fails the build); run it locally "
"before committing doc changes."

#: ../../dev.md:88
msgid ""
"线上站点由 Read the Docs 构建（`.readthedocs.yaml`，`fail_on_warning: true`）， "
"仓库里不再有发布文档的 GitHub Actions。"
msgstr ""
"The public site is built by Read the Docs (`.readthedocs.yaml`, "
"`fail_on_warning: true`); there is no GitHub Actions workflow publishing "
"docs any more."

#: ../../dev.md:90
msgid ""
"**文档是双语的**：中文是源语言，英文译文在 `docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/*.po`（每页一个）。 改完中文跑 `cd "
"docs && make update-po`，把新增/变动的条目补上 `msgstr` 即可； "
"没译的条目构建英文站时自动回落中文，所以可以分批翻。代码块不参与抽取， 示例里的注释直接用英文写。新增页面要同时生成对应的 `.po`。"
msgstr ""
"**The docs are bilingual**: Chinese is the source language and the English "
"translation lives in `docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/*.po` (one file per page)."
" After editing Chinese, run `cd docs && make update-po` and fill in the "
"`msgstr` of new or changed entries; anything left untranslated falls back "
"to Chinese in the English build, so translations can land in batches. Code "
"blocks are not extracted, so write their comments in English directly. A "
"new page needs its own `.po`."

#: ../../dev.md:94
msgid ""
"英文站要在 RTD 后台新建一个翻译项目（语言 `en`）并关联到主项目，语言切换器由 RTD 提供， "
"代码侧不需要额外配置；`docs/locale/en` 里的 `.po` 是唯一的译文来源。"
msgstr ""
"On Read the Docs, the English site is a separate translation project "
"(language `en`) linked to the main project; RTD provides the language "
"switcher and nothing is needed in the code. The `.po` files under "
"`docs/locale/en` are the only source of translations."

#: ../../dev.md:97
msgid "代码风格"
msgstr "Code style"

#: ../../dev.md:99
msgid "PEP 8，4 空格缩进，文件头 `# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-` + 模块 docstring（英文职责描述）。"
msgstr ""
"PEP 8, 4-space indentation, a `# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-` file header plus a "
"module docstring (English, describing the responsibility)."

#: ../../dev.md:100
msgid "导入顺序：标准库 → 第三方 → 项目内，组间空行，全部放文件头部。"
msgstr ""
"Import order: standard library → third party → project, a blank line "
"between groups, everything at the top of the file."

#: ../../dev.md:101
msgid "Python 3.10+ 语法，新增函数带类型注解（`str | None`、`dict[str, Any]`）。"
msgstr ""
"Python 3.10+ syntax; new functions carry type annotations (`str | None`, "
"`dict[str, Any]`)."

#: ../../dev.md:102
msgid "业务失败用 `ApiError(message, code)`（英文消息），不要裸返回 dict；不要裸 `except:`。"
msgstr ""
"Business failures use `ApiError(message, code)` (English message) instead "
"of returning a bare dict; no bare `except:`."

#: ../../dev.md:103
msgid "日志用 `logging.getLogger(__name__)`，禁止 `print()`。"
msgstr "Log with `logging.getLogger(__name__)`; `print()` is forbidden."

#: ../../dev.md:104
msgid "数据库结构变更走 `migrations/` 的幂等迁移，不要直接 `create_tables()` 改线上结构。"
msgstr ""
"Schema changes go through idempotent migrations in `migrations/`; never "
"call `create_tables()` against a live schema."

#: ../../dev.md:105
msgid "新增配置项必须同时接进「后台表单 + 实际生效点」。"
msgstr ""
"A new config option must be wired into both the admin form and the code "
"path that uses it."

